        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ocean_Springs%2C_Mississippi",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The historic downtown, lined with live oak trees, houses art galleries, shops, restaurants, and bars.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
